1
00:01:08,539 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:16,000
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,500
[Zhao Xiao]

4
00:01:37,210 --> 00:01:41,360
[Xu Jing]

5
00:01:58,860 --> 00:01:59,950
[Send it to Zhao Xiao]

6
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:00,130
[Sending]

7
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:00,820
[Send Saved Items]

8
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:06,750
[Zhao Xiao]

9
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,470
Mr. Zhao,

10
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,120
you're finally willing to answer my call.

11
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,450
Do you think
with just two pieces of paper,

12
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:19,010
you can make me continue to work with you?

13
00:02:20,270 --> 00:02:21,600
You've misunderstood.

14
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,620
You can refuse to work with me,

15
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,460
but won't you even show Mr. Pei

16
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,070
some respect?

17
00:02:29,329 --> 00:02:30,140
Xu Jing.

18
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,780
From beginning to end,
I was the one who chose you.

19
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,440
It's not because you found me.

20
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:36,130
You owe me the contract,

21
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:39,220
but what you owe me
is much more than that.

22
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:48,100
Let's put our cards on the table.

23
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:50,470
I've set my sights on you, Zhao Xiao.

24
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,840
It's not because you're handsome

25
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,800
or have great acting skills.

26
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,310
It's because I, Pei Wu,

27
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:58,000
have invested both my money
and reputation in you.

28
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,600
Since I've spent so much money,

29
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,400
I have to get some of it back, huh?

30
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:05,060
[Fourthly,
Remuneration and Payment Methods]

31
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:06,840
Mr. Pei,

32
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,520
about the remuneration...

33
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,150
Zhao Xiao.

34
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:10,210
Right now,

35
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,310
you're definitely not worth

36
00:03:11,310 --> 00:03:13,310
the price we originally discussed.

37
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:15,430
No one in the market
dares to hire you now,

38
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,430
but I dare to do so.

39
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,810
You'd better seize this opportunity.

40
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:40,250
[Party B: Zhao Xiao]

41
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,590
Thank you for your trust, Mr. Pei.

42
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:51,710
I definitely won't let you down.

43
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:52,850
Prepare well.

44
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,060
I'm quite looking forward to it, too.

45
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,240
I need to remind you

46
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,270
that you should
get some work done on your face.

47
00:04:01,270 --> 00:04:03,910
After all, the role you're going to play
covers a big time span.

48
00:04:03,910 --> 00:04:06,170
The age ranges from sixteen to thirties.

49
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,030
I'm really afraid
that in your current state,

50
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,400
you won't be able to handle it.

51
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,500
You know this, too.

52
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,800
Nowadays, these trending celebrities
are getting younger and younger.

53
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,870
When the camera rolls,

54
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:15,030
and you stand next to them,

55
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,930
what advantages can you have?

56
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,680
Right?

57
00:04:19,269 --> 00:04:20,040
Mr. Zhang is here.

58
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,920
Let's go now.

59
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,170
Don't forget what you've promised me.

60
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,970
Show your best self.

61
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,370
If you have any problems,
you can talk to Xu.

62
00:04:28,370 --> 00:04:30,720
I have another gathering,
so I'll leave first.

63
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,780
Take care, Mr. Pei.

64
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,430
Mr. Zhao,

65
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:42,530
your skin has indeed developed lesions.

66
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,480
I would suggest a timely repair.

67
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,159
Then when can I have the surgery?

68
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:54,270
I hope I can have it as soon as possible.

69
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,040
That depends on

70
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,630
the schedules of you and the skin donor.

71
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,010
The skin donor?

72
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,390
You mean the person who helped me
with the skin graft last time?

73
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,120
Yes.

74
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:06,040
If you want your skin
to recover to its best condition,

75
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,920
the person who helped you
with the skin graft back then

76
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,920
must provide her skin for you again.

77
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:29,230
[Agricultural Bank of China]

78
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,400
What did Dr. Fang say?

79
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:38,510
He is the top doctor

80
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:40,040
I could find in our country.

81
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,020
He's also Chunqing's doctor.

82
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:45,530
He wants to schedule a surgery for me.

83
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:46,260
When?

84
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:48,570
I still need some time.

85
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:50,800
Why?

86
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,430
I have to find my ex-wife first

87
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:58,090
before I can have the surgery.

88
00:05:58,190 --> 00:06:00,190
This piece of skin on my face is hers.

89
00:06:00,740 --> 00:06:04,120
To repair it, I must use her skin again.

90
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,510
You must use it again?

91
00:06:08,710 --> 00:06:10,710
Will she still be willing to do that?

92
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,120
I'll handle this.

93
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,450
You don't need to worry about it.
Let's go.

94
00:06:17,300 --> 00:06:25,120
[Zhao Xiao]

95
00:06:34,850 --> 00:06:36,730
Hello, A'lan.

96
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,610
It's me. I'm sorry

97
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,600
for bothering you at this late hour.

98
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,000
If you know you're sorry,

99
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,530
why are you still bothering me?

100
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:47,280
What do you want to use me for this time?

101
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,480
A'lan, it's not like what you think.

102
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,560
I... I just missed you so much.

103
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,480
You missed me?

104
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:56,430
If you missed me, why did you shake me off

105
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:58,090
as soon as you saw me last time?

106
00:06:58,510 --> 00:07:01,640
If you missed me,
why have you hurt me over and over again?

107
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:02,720
A'lan, regarding what happened last time,

108
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,180
I haven't had the chance
to explain it to you.

109
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,530
After all, I'm a public figure.

110
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,630
If they had taken pictures of us...

111
00:07:09,630 --> 00:07:10,240
Zhao Xiao.

112
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,510
I'm your ex-wife,

113
00:07:12,510 --> 00:07:13,720
not your mistress.

114
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:15,820
You're wearing the face I gave you,

115
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:17,720
and you abandoned me after using me.

116
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,180
Now you think I'm unpresentable,
don't you?

117
00:07:20,370 --> 00:07:21,160
A'lan.

118
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,680
I'm really sorry.

119
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,300
I know I've brought you endless pain.

120
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:25,960
But...

121
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:28,640
I want to beg you
to give me another chance.

122
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,430
Please forgive me,

123
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,150
okay?

124
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:34,040
Because you're the only one I've ever
loved from beginning to end.

125
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,860
Really?

126
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,090
Xiao.

127
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,290
You can't lie to me anymore.

128
00:07:42,870 --> 00:07:43,590
A'lan.

129
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,390
I've never lied to you.

130
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:47,920
Previously, it was all because of that...

131
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,680
that wretched woman, Lin Di'er.

132
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,830
She threatened me with a ten-million-yuan
breach-of-contract penalty

133
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,310
and confined me.

134
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,240
Actually,

135
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,630
I've been looking for you all these years.

136
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:57,400
A'lan.

137
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,270
Please give me a chance.

138
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,600
This time, I will definitely protect you.

139
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,920
I got it, Xiao.

140
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:08,480
I must have misunderstood you.

141
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,360
A'lan.

142
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,560
So, have you forgiven me?

143
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:14,120
I...

144
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:14,920
It's okay.

145
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,660
I know

146
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,250
you'll need some time to think about this.

147
00:08:18,450 --> 00:08:19,530
I'll wait for you.

148
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:21,700
So, before you can forgive me,

149
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:24,720
can we meet?

150
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,270
Okay.

151
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:28,510
Xiao.

152
00:08:30,590 --> 00:08:32,419
Next time, you must show up.

153
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:35,690
You can't leave me alone again.

154
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:41,549
Okay.

155
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,160
[Finish]

156
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,370
[A'lan]

157
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,270
A'lan, I've arrived.

158
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:15,070
Where are you?

159
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:20,870
A'lan, thank you

160
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,160
for finding such a hidden place.

161
00:09:24,630 --> 00:09:25,360
I promise

162
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:27,390
I will make our relationship public later.

163
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,660
Your dedication to me

164
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:30,030
won't be in vain.

165
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,440
Xiao! Xiao!

166
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:42,240
You're finally willing to see me, Xiao!

167
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,120
Wait!

168
00:09:43,290 --> 00:09:44,000
-Xiao!
-Who are you?

169
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,670
Don't worry.

170
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:45,800
It's very safe here.

171
00:09:45,970 --> 00:09:47,510
-Let go of me!
-No one will know about our relationship.

172
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,150
Xiao.

173
00:09:48,190 --> 00:09:49,190
Take photos now!

174
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,520
Stop taking photos!

175
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,680
It's him.

176
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:06,590
[Zhao Xiao Slept with His Fan]

177
00:10:01,650 --> 00:10:03,030
The topic of Zhao Xiao secretly

178
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,320
dating his fan

179
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,650
has already
hit the major trending topics platforms.

180
00:10:06,650 --> 00:10:07,550
Ms. Xu,

181
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:10,780
how far do you think the topic
of Zhao Xiao sleeping with his fan

182
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:12,440
will escalate?

183
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:13,660
Xiao.

184
00:10:12,770 --> 00:10:16,120
[Zhao Xiao]

185
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,720
This is the cinema
where you proposed to me.

186
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,370
When the ending song
of "Notting Hill" began to play,

187
00:10:19,370 --> 00:10:21,680
-you knelt down and asked me to marry you.
-Ms. Xu.

188
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,670
[Zhao Xiao]

189
00:10:22,710 --> 00:10:24,030
Have you forgotten

190
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,630
such an important moment?

191
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:26,820
There is no limit.

192
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:29,080
Then regarding the PR expenses this time,

193
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,510
I'm afraid the initial costs

194
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,770
will be considerable.

195
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:35,080
Xiao, I've arrived.

196
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:37,940
[Zhao Xiao]

197
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:36,550
Where are you?

198
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,860
Are you going to abandon me again?

199
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,260
Miss Li,
you don't need to worry about this.

200
00:10:41,260 --> 00:10:43,390
All the expenses required for this...

201
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,700
will be borne by him.

202
00:10:46,090 --> 00:10:48,230
[Zhao Xiao Slept with His Fan]

203
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,270
Okay.

204
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:52,730
[Zhao Xiao, the top star of Yingcheng,
is trapped in the "Private Cinema Scandal"]

205
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:52,900
[The scandal of sleeping with his fan
shocked the entertainment industry.]

206
00:10:52,930 --> 00:10:55,770
[Trending Topic] [Zhao Xiao's fan
committed suicide.] [Wang Yue's Suicide]

207
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,980
A leopard can't change its spots.

208
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,840
I feel sorry for those female fans
who are devoted to him.

209
00:10:57,840 --> 00:11:00,850
But the way he looks at his female fans
is weird, too.

210
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,600
I support the victimized girl
in stepping forward.

211
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,870
So despicable.

212
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,680
There's even a fan
who has committed suicide for him?

213
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,030
-What are his fans to him?
-That's a pure exploitation and deception.

214
00:11:07,030 --> 00:11:08,030
How can we even watch his next drama?

215
00:11:07,940 --> 00:11:08,180
[Zhao Xiao Secretly Dated His Fan in a Cinema]
[Zhao Xiao Slept with His Fan]

216
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:09,030
That's a human life.

217
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:08,750
[I've long told you that the way
he looks at his female fans is weird.]

218
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:09,230
[Now it's disgusting to think about
how he "pampered his fans" before.]

219
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,240
Zhao Xiao, can you sleep at night?

220
00:11:09,250 --> 00:11:09,820
[These are all tricks.]

221
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:10,790
[Online Comments]

222
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,240
What top star?

223
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,030
-I think he's a scoundrel.
-My God. This scandal is getting scarier.

224
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:13,640
Who is Wang Yue?

225
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,970
-It's terrifying how he dumped his wife!
-According to the news,

226
00:11:14,970 --> 00:11:16,670
-Based on how Zhao Xiao slept with his fan,
-it happened a few years ago.

227
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:17,510
it was exactly the same.

228
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:20,240
-But his scandals were exposed successively.
-So this wasn't his first time doing it?

229
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,670
-Isn't Wang Yue's life valuable?
-Maybe he offended someone or it's revenge.

230
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:23,270
Why wasn't this exposed back then?

231
00:11:23,270 --> 00:11:25,120
Is this what you call
the PR crisis management?

232
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,080
After you dealt with the PR crisis,

233
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,270
you just let people keep cursing me, huh?

234
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,600
Can't you see how much this has escalated?

235
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:32,150
Are you guys blind?

236
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:35,000
We are dealing with it urgently, but...

237
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:35,990
But what?

238
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:38,840
The nature of your incident
is quite severe.

239
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:41,150
Negative news keeps popping up.

240
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:43,820
Did I pay you guys to mock me?

241
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,140
Just wait to be sued by me.
